    "96x96 is the qualified teacher focus; other compiler sizes are unit-tested, not implied to have the same native/aesthetic coverage."
  ],
  "admission_scope": "Native validity plus provisional family/control fidelity. Artistic quality remains a development target; this review is not the final model benchmark."
